# Afterdream (PPSA18391) -- from a fresh boot with EMPTY save directories, past the first-boot
# language menu (English, the default item) and the warning card into the in-engine opening scene.
#
# A generic probe, not a hand-tuned route: a one-second Cross every 8 s from 20 s, in SECONDS from the
# guest's first pad poll. Measured on 2026-10-09 (prosper-app, Linux/RADV, main a56a085e1, 59.9
# guest flips/s): the language menu holds until the first press, the warning card is up at about pad
# flip 2000, and the dialogue scene in the sitting room is drawn from pad flip 3000 to the end of a
# 300 s run, advancing one line per press.
#
# Use it as PROSPER_PAD_SCRIPT=@<path> -- without the @ the script loads 0 entries.
